// Library.DocView.ailang
// Paper camera paint. Widget chrome = Theme.window_bg, sheet = Theme.page_bg.
// Direct blit into the window canvas; no VIEW_SURF in v1.
// Copyright © 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL.

